<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8079" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέζω</span></b> , pres. not found, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς δίφρον ἀνέσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.657
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς εὐνὴν ἀνέσαιμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.209
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.310
			</span></i> (tm.); <i>restore to one's place.</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ οἶδ᾽ ἢ κέν μ᾽ ἀνέσει θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					18.265
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>sit upright,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὰ δ᾽ ἕζετο σιγῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1170
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				4.1332
			</span></i>.</div>
